big.\n   - Other rules (e.g., \"kind + big \u2192 young\") do not apply to Anne because she is not kind. Thus, no contradictions arise.\n\n**Conclusion:** The statement \"Anne is not big\" is **false**, so the correct answer is **B) False**.",
